SUMMARY:Time Travel Half Marathon/5K/10K - Chattanooga
DESCRIPTION:Time Travel Half Marathon/5K/10K features multiple distance options including a Kid's Dash (ages 10 and under) and 1 Mile untimed run. All registrations include custom bib\, designer shirt\, and finisher medal. Chip-timing with live results and awards for timed events. Virtual race option available. Early bird pricing available through December 13\, 2026.
LOCATION:Chattanooga\, TN 37406 US
STATUS:CONFIRMED
