DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270410T070000Z
DTEND:20270410T110000Z
SUMMARY:Mountain Ridge Trail Race
DESCRIPTION:Mountain Ridge Trail Race takes place on the Douglas County East-West Regional Trail near Highlands Ranch. This gently rolling course features 100% dirt trail and single-track trails with manageable elevation gains and scenic front range views. The race offers four distance options with staggered start times and includes live tracking\, aid stations\, and volunteer opportunities.
LOCATION:Mountain Ridge Middle School\, 10590 Mountain Vista Ridge\, Highlands Ranch\, CO 80126
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:the-colorado-marathon-2027@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270502T080000Z
DTEND:20270502T120000Z
SUMMARY:The Colorado Marathon
DESCRIPTION:One of Colorado's fastest downhill races held in the scenic Poudre Canyon along the Cache La Poudre River in the Rocky Mountains. The race offers four distance options and is designated as the RRCA Colorado State Marathon Championship. Known for stunning mountain scenery\, excellent Boston Marathon qualifier rate (16-18%)\, and commitment to sustainability.
LOCATION:Poudre Canyon\, Fort Collins\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
