SUMMARY:Denver Colfax Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Denver's largest marathon weekend in the Rocky Mountain region\, featuring multiple race options including Denver's only marathon running through Empower Field at Mile High Stadium\, a half marathon through Denver Zoo\, an urban 10 miler\, marathon relay\, and 5K. Includes race photos\, shirt\, lunch\, drinks\, huge expo\, and post-race party with live music and food.
LOCATION:TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
