UID:ring-the-springs-2027@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270619T060000Z
DTEND:20270619T100000Z
SUMMARY:Ring the Springs
DESCRIPTION:Ring the Springs is a trail running event featuring 100K (64 miles\, 11\,065 ft elevation gain)\, 50K (32.3 miles\, 5\,115 ft elevation gain)\, and 35K (21.5 miles\, 3\,388 ft elevation gain) distances. The courses weave through Colorado Springs' majestic mountains\, scenic city parks\, and iconic landmarks including North Cheyenne Cañon and Pike National Forest\, starting and finishing at historic Rock Ledge Ranch in Garden of the Gods.
LOCATION:Rock Ledge Ranch at Garden of The Gods\, 3105 Gateway Road\, Colorado Springs\, CO 80904
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
