UID:hardrock-100-2027@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270709T060000Z
DTEND:20270709T100000Z
SUMMARY:Hardrock 100
DESCRIPTION:100-mile endurance run in the San Juan Mountains of Colorado with 66\,882 feet of total elevation change. Lottery-based entry system with qualifying requirements. 2027 lottery draw scheduled for December 5\, 2026 at 9:00 AM MST.
LOCATION:Silverton\, Colorado
STATUS:CONFIRMED
