UID:the-grand-traverse-run-2027@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270904T060000Z
DTEND:20270904T100000Z
SUMMARY:The Grand Traverse Run
DESCRIPTION:Point-to-point ultramarathon from Crested Butte to Aspen across the Elk Mountains with over 6\,000' of elevation gain. Follows the route of the Grand Traverse Backcountry Ski race. Fundraising event for Crested Butte Nordic\, a 501(c)(3) recreational non-profit organization. Registration opens December 1\, 2026 at midnight.
LOCATION:Town Park\, Crested Butte\, CO (Start) / Ajax Park – 1001 S. Ute Ave\, Aspen\, CO (Finish)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
