SUMMARY:Golden Harvest Half Marathon & 5K/10K - Denver
DESCRIPTION:Family-friendly race featuring multiple distance options with custom finisher medals\, designer shirts\, chip timing\, live results\, and awards. Includes kid's dash (1 mile\, untimed\, ages 10 & under) and virtual event options. Youth pricing available for 12 & under ($17). Race day schedule: 6:30-7:45am packet pickup\, 7:55am kids dash\, 8:00am national anthem and race start.
