UID:snow-mountain-ranch-trail-running-festival-2027@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270918T063000Z
DTEND:20270918T103000Z
SUMMARY:Snow Mountain Ranch Trail Running Festival
DESCRIPTION:The 13th annual Snow Mountain Ranch Trail Running Festival features 5 races on wide open Nordic tracks at the YMCA of the Rockies in Granby. Races include a 50K\, 33K\, Half Marathon\, 10K\, and 5K with courses on 100% dirt terrain surrounded by changing colors\, rolling hills\, and picturesque views. Registration closes September 13\, 2027 at 11:59 PM MT.
LOCATION:1101 County Rd 53\, Granby\, CO 80446
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pikes-peak-marathon-2027@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270918T070000Z
DTEND:20270918T110000Z
SUMMARY:Pikes Peak Marathon
DESCRIPTION:A grueling 13.3 mile trail race from downtown Manitou Springs to the 14\,115 foot summit of Pikes Peak via the historic Barr Trail. Features a vertical climb of 7\,800 feet with an average 11% grade\, winding through pine and aspen forests before climbing above tree line into alpine views. Registration opens March 1\, 2027 at 5:00 AM MST with tiered pricing starting at $175.
LOCATION:441 Manitou Ave\, Suite 100\, Manitou Springs\, CO 80829
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:boulderthon-2027@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20270926T080000Z
DTEND:20270926T120000Z
SUMMARY:Boulderthon
DESCRIPTION:Colorado's Premier Fall Race Weekend. A boutique marathon experience featuring mountain backdrops\, fall foliage\, and an electric finish line at the foothills of the Rockies. Every finisher receives an exclusive limited-edition lululemon piece. Rated Top 10 in America by USA Today. Features 100% hemp bibs\, recycled medals\, live music\, community cheer zones\, and an epic after-party with outdoor expo on Pearl Street.
LOCATION:TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
