DESCRIPTION:14th Annual Colorado Springs Marathon featuring 4 events. This family-friendly premiere endurance running event showcases the city of Colorado Springs\, taking runners past historic monuments\, through beautiful parks\, culminating in downtown at the Colorado Springs Pioneers Museum with post-race celebration.
